

EXCELSIOR! Professional BBS Demonstration v1.21K - Feb 5, 1996


To install the BBS double-click the "INSTALL_BBS" icon from the Workbench.
This must be used in order to operate the BBS correctly.


XPrefs allows you to configure your system.

Master is the main program that must be run to use EXCELSIOR! BBS.
This controls all aspects of the BBS operation.

Some color-flicker may occur if you use the standard Workbench colors.
We recommend using CpuBlit V1.00 © 1991 Eddy Carroll, or a program
similiar that removes the annonying C= flicker.  IBM ANSI color will also
remove this (selected from the Screen/Preferences menu (Right-Amiga 1).
